<mt:Ignore>
  History timeline — AZ-COMネットワークの歩み
  Wrapper + section title; each year via azcom-history-timeline-item.
</mt:Ignore>

<section class="c-history-timeline" aria-labelledby="history-timeline-heading" id="steps">
  <div class="l-container">
    <mt:SetVar name="section_title_id" value="history-timeline-heading">
    <mt:SetVarBlock name="section_title_text">AZ-COMネットワークの歩み</mt:SetVarBlock>
    <mt:Include module="azcom-section-title">

    <div class="c-history-timeline__items">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2015">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2015年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">4月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>任意団体として「AZ-COM丸和・支援ネットワーク」を設立</li>
            <li>第1回総会</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">7月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>第1回パートナー企業研修会</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">8月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>第1回海外視察研修を開催し、ベルギー・フランス・スペインを訪問</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2016">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2016年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">11月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>任意団体AZ-COM丸和・支援ネットワークを母体として「一般社団法人AZ-COM丸和・支援ネットワーク」を設立</li>
            <li>拠点を東京都千代田区丸の内に移転</li>
            <li>AZ-COMネット会員数、500会員突破</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2017">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2017年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">8月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>ETC大口・多額度割引サービスを開始（AZ-COM協同組合）</li>
            <li>埼玉県吉川市・松伏町と大規模災害時における支援活動に関する協定を締結</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2018">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2018年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">11月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>AZ-COMネット会員数、1,000会員突破</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2019">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2019年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">11月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>第1回AZ-COM丸和・支援ネットワークゴルフコンペ</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2021">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2021年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">11月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>AZ-COMネット会員数、1,500会員突破</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2023">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2023年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">6月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>内閣府より災害対策基本方針に基づく指定公共機関に指定</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">7月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>富山県と大規模災害時における支援活動に関する協定を締結し、協定締結自治体が50ヶ所に拡大</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2024">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2024年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">1月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>内閣府ならびに協定締結自治体からの要望に基づき、被災地向け支援物資の輸送支援活動に従事</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">7月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>日本小売業協会・日本3PL協会と初の「ASEAN視察研修」を共催</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">10月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>AZ-COMネット会員数、2,500会員突破</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">11月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>創立10周年記念研修会</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

<mt:SetVar name="history_timeline_year_slug" value="2025">
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_year">2025年</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:SetVarBlock name="history_timeline_body">
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">4月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>法人名を「一般社団法人AZ-COMネットワーク」に変更</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-history-timeline__row">
        <div class="c-history-timeline__month">11月</div>
        <div class="c-history-timeline__text">
          <ul class="c-history-timeline__list">
            <li>茨城県と「大規模災害時における支援活動に関する協定」を締結し、協定締結自治体が75ヶ所に拡大</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
</mt:SetVarBlock>
<mt:Include module="azcom-history-timeline-item">

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
